# =====================================================================
# LogoMind .gitignore
# =====================================================================
# LogoMind is primarily a knowledge repository (Markdown, diagrams).
# This .gitignore excludes OS/editor cruft and reserves space for
# future software build artifacts without committing them.
# =====================================================================

# --- OS-generated files ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE temp files ---
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# --- ZCode / agent working files ---
.zcode/

# --- Temporary / scratch ---
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
tmp/
temp/

# --- Future: application build artifacts (reserved, not used yet) ---
# When Phase 5 (Technical Build) begins, these will keep software
# dependencies out of the knowledge repository.
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.local
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
.next/
.cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- Future: uploads / user-generated content ---
uploads/
media/

# --- Keep these (do NOT ignore) ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
